WEBVTT

00:25.190 --> 00:26.950
In a future to come...

00:27.090 --> 00:31.420
the third energy revolution arrives
with the invention of the Shizuma Drive...

00:31.630 --> 00:34.600
and mankind reaches a
newfound period of prosperity.

00:40.070 --> 00:42.870
But within the shadows
of this bright peace...

00:42.970 --> 00:45.740
two powers clash against each other.

00:48.040 --> 00:52.340
A secret organization bent on
world domination, the BF Group!

00:53.280 --> 00:56.380
Everything for Big Fire!

01:16.570 --> 01:19.800
And to oppose this threat,
the Experts of Justice...

01:19.910 --> 01:22.810
is formed from members
gathered from all across the globe!

01:22.910 --> 01:24.780
The International Police Organization!

01:24.950 --> 01:29.650
With them is the most powerful
robot on the planet, Giant Robo...

01:29.780 --> 01:32.250
and the young man who commands it.

01:32.390 --> 01:34.510
His name is Daisaku Kusama!

01:36.290 --> 01:38.230
Crush them! Giant Robo!

01:44.500 --> 01:52.500
<i>GIANT ROBO</i>

01:59.410 --> 02:04.910
<i>THE DAY THE EARTH STOOD STILL</i>

02:07.150 --> 02:09.780
I've been using the Shizuma
Drive without knowing...

02:09.890 --> 02:12.330
anything about the
Tragedy of Bashtarle.

02:12.790 --> 02:15.190
I'd never even thought
twice about using it.

02:15.460 --> 02:17.230
I will never forgive myself for that.

02:17.800 --> 02:20.200
But first comes the BF Group...

02:20.300 --> 02:22.400
and Professor Vogler!

02:23.700 --> 02:25.830
I will never forgive any of you...

02:26.070 --> 02:28.300
I will avenge Professor Shizuma's death.

02:30.040 --> 02:31.510
Crush him, Robo!

02:34.820 --> 02:36.410
N-No, don't!

02:36.720 --> 02:38.150
Daisaku, don't fight it!

02:38.250 --> 02:40.380
No, stop! Daisaku!

02:42.560 --> 02:45.250
Please stop! Father!

02:46.990 --> 02:50.950
Go!

03:09.780 --> 03:10.780
This is not happening...

03:17.560 --> 03:18.560
Robo!

03:22.600 --> 03:23.600
Robo!

03:25.970 --> 03:32.130
<i>Episode 4: Twilight of the Heroes!
The Bells of Victory Have Yet to Toll!</i>

03:37.650 --> 03:38.980
Oh no...

03:39.180 --> 03:40.180
Robo...

03:40.350 --> 03:41.910
How can this be?

03:42.250 --> 03:42.650
No...

03:43.080 --> 03:44.520
Daisaku!

04:07.840 --> 04:09.830
Giant Robo has been defeated!

04:33.400 --> 04:34.400
Daisaku!

04:44.810 --> 04:47.910
You foolish nuclear-powered puppet!

04:48.550 --> 04:51.020
I'll bury you along with
all the Shizuma Drives!

05:02.600 --> 05:05.120
This is bad! They're
planning to finish Robo off!

05:05.600 --> 05:07.330
Run, Daisaku!

05:16.280 --> 05:17.280
W-What's this?

05:21.520 --> 05:22.520
The Blue Beast!

05:23.220 --> 05:25.410
What are you all standing around for?

05:25.890 --> 05:26.890
That's right!

05:27.990 --> 05:30.180
Hurry and go help Daisaku!

05:30.460 --> 05:32.720
While the Electromagnetic
Wire Net is still operational!

05:35.100 --> 05:36.100
Okay!

05:45.140 --> 05:46.400
That fool Ivan!

05:47.010 --> 05:49.030
How could he leave so many of them!

05:55.080 --> 05:56.980
Issei! Now's your chance!

05:57.150 --> 06:00.266
Youshi and I will follow after we get
the Electromagnetic Wire Net stabilized!

06:00.290 --> 06:00.880
Right!

06:00.990 --> 06:02.350
Calling all positions!

06:02.520 --> 06:06.090
Reroute control of the
Net Machines to my location...

06:06.490 --> 06:09.050
and evacuate to the Greta Garbo!

06:09.230 --> 06:10.230
Move!

06:20.540 --> 06:22.410
F-Father...

06:22.540 --> 06:23.540
Ginrei?

06:24.580 --> 06:25.880
What's the matter?

06:26.410 --> 06:27.410
Hurry!

06:28.320 --> 06:29.320
Okay!

06:31.290 --> 06:32.690
Dear!

06:34.720 --> 06:36.590
How are the controls coming?

06:36.760 --> 06:38.730
Set it up and let's get out of here!

06:38.990 --> 06:43.020
I don't think they're going
to let us retreat so easily!

06:44.600 --> 06:49.000
Yeah, this definitely won't be easy...

06:54.410 --> 06:55.410
Dear?

06:57.510 --> 06:58.710
Say...

06:59.410 --> 07:01.910
I have a favor to ask...

07:02.820 --> 07:04.380
Will you hear it?

07:09.120 --> 07:10.120
Robo...

07:16.030 --> 07:17.030
R-Robo...

07:24.970 --> 07:25.970
Get up Robo!

07:26.240 --> 07:27.330
We have to escape!

07:40.220 --> 07:41.220
Hurry!

07:41.560 --> 07:42.960
Hurry up and stand! Robo!

07:43.360 --> 07:44.150
Come on!

07:44.290 --> 07:45.520
Move Robo!

07:46.360 --> 07:47.560
Move!

07:55.200 --> 07:56.930
R-Robo?

07:57.640 --> 07:58.640
Robo?

08:12.250 --> 08:13.690
What have I...

08:14.360 --> 08:18.320
Robo!

08:35.640 --> 08:36.640
Daisaku...

08:44.420 --> 08:45.510
Daisaku!

08:48.960 --> 08:52.190
Don't either of you make a move.

08:52.360 --> 08:53.590
Especially you, monk!

08:53.690 --> 08:55.090
You're troublesome.

08:55.230 --> 08:57.990
I want to see both your hands at all times.

09:05.440 --> 09:07.810
We can't have you using those, can we?

09:09.180 --> 09:11.980
That package you're
holding. Is it that case?

09:14.650 --> 09:19.550
If you don't want me to blow up his
head, you better hand that case to me.

09:30.200 --> 09:31.260
Ginrei! Now!

09:31.370 --> 09:32.370
Okay!

09:36.100 --> 09:37.100
Daisaku!

09:37.840 --> 09:39.170
Why you!

09:40.240 --> 09:41.830
Ginrei! Go on ahead!

09:41.940 --> 09:42.940
Right!

09:51.150 --> 09:52.740
You damned monk!

10:07.200 --> 10:08.970
Mister Alberto!

10:10.700 --> 10:14.040
The case that woman is
holding contains the real Sample.

10:14.610 --> 10:17.740
The increasing resonance between
the Samples is proof enough!

10:18.750 --> 10:21.550
See to it that you recover it this time.

10:23.080 --> 10:24.950
I've heard enough out of you, whelp!

10:28.260 --> 10:30.450
Mister Enshaku! We're going out as well!

10:36.230 --> 10:39.670
Please observe, using the signals
being emitted from the attache case...

10:39.770 --> 10:43.070
containing the sample from Shanghai,
we created this copy here in the lab.

10:43.170 --> 10:45.800
Had we used a normal
Shizuma Drive, it would be...

10:45.910 --> 10:48.030
completely inoperable
in the Anti-Shizuma field...

10:48.180 --> 10:51.630
but being that the Sample
itself is a Negative Shizuma Drive...

10:51.910 --> 10:53.710
it's not being affected at all.

10:54.080 --> 10:57.020
And by bringing our Sample
close to the other two...

10:57.120 --> 10:59.780
we can gather data
on what would happen...

10:59.890 --> 11:02.410
if all three Samples
were brought together...

11:02.560 --> 11:05.390
and hopefully we'll be
able to figure out a way to...

11:05.490 --> 11:08.950
stop the energy
nullification phenomenon...

11:09.060 --> 11:10.190
However...

11:11.630 --> 11:14.930
In exchange, Shanghai will fall...

11:19.570 --> 11:22.840
That may be too high a price to pay...

11:23.040 --> 11:26.610
even if I'm the one in
command of this operation.

11:26.780 --> 11:28.080
What are you saying, sir?

11:28.180 --> 11:29.880
I'm sure all the men involved...

11:29.980 --> 11:32.450
understand your position and
the choices you have to make.

11:32.650 --> 11:35.650
Take Daisaku, for example...

11:42.300 --> 11:44.700
He saw Professor Shizuma
killed before his eyes...

11:45.030 --> 11:47.190
and even though he could control Robo...

11:47.300 --> 11:49.290
he was forced to
learn the harsh truth...

11:49.400 --> 11:53.170
he himself is just a boy who
can't do anything on his own.

11:53.510 --> 11:57.100
In reaction to that, his youthful heart
wanted to lash out and go into battle...

11:57.240 --> 11:59.410
but he was ordered to stay put.

12:00.210 --> 12:02.880
And, this is the final result...

12:03.250 --> 12:06.710
No, the outcome has not been decided yet.

12:08.620 --> 12:12.290
And aren't you the one
who's always saying that...

12:12.430 --> 12:17.330
the battle really begins when
you realize your own potential?

12:19.200 --> 12:20.200
Professor Go...

12:22.670 --> 12:28.010
Now we must believe in them.

12:28.280 --> 12:31.480
Eight survivors from Unit P have come
aboard! No survivors from Units K, L or M!

12:31.510 --> 12:33.740
Twelve men from Units R,
Q and S are on their way!

12:33.850 --> 12:35.426
Will they make it before
Greta Garbo is out of range?

12:35.450 --> 12:37.826
Hurry! We don't know when the Giant
Sphere will start to move again!

12:37.850 --> 12:40.720
All personnel able to move, form
medical teams to assist the wounded!

12:40.820 --> 12:41.380
Move!

12:41.490 --> 12:42.250
Daisaku!

12:42.360 --> 12:43.360
Ginrei!

12:44.960 --> 12:47.620
Where are Daisaku and Ginrei?

12:47.730 --> 12:50.600
T-They were attacked
by the Magnificent Ten...

13:00.110 --> 13:02.740
Woman, you think you can hide?

13:06.010 --> 13:07.780
I'll smoke you out!

13:20.490 --> 13:21.860
There you are!

13:29.570 --> 13:31.440
Is that your idea of a rear guard?

13:31.540 --> 13:35.170
Is this the best the International Police
Organization's Experts of Justice can do?

13:39.680 --> 13:41.410
Now then! I'll finish this!

13:46.820 --> 13:48.250
The Magnificent Ten again?

13:48.860 --> 13:49.860
More of them?

13:51.660 --> 13:52.660
Who is he?

14:07.470 --> 14:08.530
Daisaku!

14:11.610 --> 14:14.340
It's all over. You'll not escape!

14:15.520 --> 14:17.380
Prepare yourself, woman!

14:34.940 --> 14:36.460
Ginrei?

14:38.170 --> 14:39.170
What's the matter?

14:44.680 --> 14:46.040
It-It can't be!

14:53.220 --> 14:55.350
G-Ginrei...

15:05.170 --> 15:06.660
Come back here!

15:12.570 --> 15:15.370
Fire! Fire! Fire!

15:30.920 --> 15:32.450
How dare they...

15:32.560 --> 15:35.650
I'll shoot down that antique ship!

15:37.660 --> 15:38.860
That's enough!

15:43.240 --> 15:44.240
What now?

15:44.810 --> 15:47.140
I'm making some changes to the operation...

15:47.340 --> 15:50.610
Yes, before we try to recover that case...

15:50.810 --> 15:53.580
we will blow up the
oil fields of Shanghai.

15:53.810 --> 15:55.080
Are you serious?

15:55.950 --> 15:57.880
I am, Mister Alberto.

16:07.490 --> 16:11.230
As you can see, Vogler
is already in preparation.

16:11.530 --> 16:13.560
You're not going to do that, are you?

16:14.000 --> 16:16.830
Yes, this operation's
objective was to capture the...

16:16.940 --> 16:20.670
last oil field on Earth,
here in Shanghai, in order to...

16:20.770 --> 16:25.580
make a base of operations once all
the Shizuma Drives have been nullified.

16:26.280 --> 16:34.280
But if I blow it up, even us members of
the BF Group would be unable to use it.

16:35.220 --> 16:37.280
That's your concern, isn't it?

16:37.520 --> 16:38.860
Of course it is!

16:39.030 --> 16:40.220
Explain yourself!

16:40.530 --> 16:42.550
There is no need to.

16:43.500 --> 16:44.590
Have you forgotten?

16:44.700 --> 16:47.846
The project leader of this operation
has the authority to make all decisions...

16:47.870 --> 16:49.100
and that authority is mine!

16:49.200 --> 16:53.260
In other words, my commands are
those of our leader, Big Fire himself!

16:58.980 --> 17:00.610
Do whatever you will...

17:02.450 --> 17:04.250
I forgot something.

17:04.450 --> 17:05.680
Not to worry.

17:05.790 --> 17:07.880
I'll be back at the
rendezvous point in no time.

17:07.990 --> 17:12.020
Besides, I want to see that woman again.

17:13.130 --> 17:16.220
She showed me something very interesting.

17:16.330 --> 17:22.360
Until today, I thought only one particular
person had such an amazing power.

17:29.410 --> 17:33.400
But, how can this be?

17:48.090 --> 17:49.260
Robo...

17:49.730 --> 17:50.730
Robo...

17:57.670 --> 17:58.670
Robo...

18:06.150 --> 18:07.440
Robo...

18:07.810 --> 18:11.150
Daisaku, it's all right now.

18:11.450 --> 18:13.480
The enemy has pulled back.

18:13.590 --> 18:16.320
So you can rest easy and call Robo back.

18:16.420 --> 18:17.950
All right?

18:19.560 --> 18:20.560
I...

18:21.260 --> 18:22.790
I can't!

18:24.130 --> 18:25.130
What?

18:26.000 --> 18:29.990
I've been trying, but Robo won't move...

18:30.600 --> 18:32.540
I've tried again and
again, but it's no good.

18:34.010 --> 18:37.030
It's probably because
I disobeyed orders...

18:39.180 --> 18:45.740
That's why Robo won't listen to me anymore!

18:47.220 --> 18:49.120
He'll probably never...

18:51.120 --> 18:52.520
Stop your whining!

19:00.770 --> 19:01.930
Big sister...

19:08.440 --> 19:12.240
Daisaku, is this how
you want to leave things?

19:12.380 --> 19:14.310
Do you want to abandon Robo here?

19:16.280 --> 19:17.680
If so...

19:18.990 --> 19:22.440
Then why is my husband still
back there trying to buy you time?

19:22.820 --> 19:23.080
What?

19:23.390 --> 19:24.390
Huh?

19:24.760 --> 19:26.920
Brother Taiso?

19:36.970 --> 19:40.340
Favor, you say?

19:42.310 --> 19:44.110
I can't leave.

19:45.110 --> 19:46.810
This thing got damaged during...

19:46.910 --> 19:49.510
the last attack and the
automation system's been fried.

19:50.450 --> 19:56.820
Someone has to stay here and
keep that Giant Sphere under control.

19:58.830 --> 19:59.830
You're not..

20:00.230 --> 20:01.390
Yeah, I am.

20:01.600 --> 20:03.930
The operation was a failure...

20:04.530 --> 20:08.800
But even though this thing can't
launch the Sphere into space...

20:08.900 --> 20:12.000
it can slow it down for a while.

20:12.640 --> 20:16.270
Think about it! If Robo is
destroyed here in Shanghai...

20:16.440 --> 20:17.840
That thing is nuclear.

20:17.940 --> 20:20.740
The problem with the Shizuma
Drives would be nothing in comparison.

20:21.350 --> 20:26.310
And I'm not about to let Robo, who
fought with us against the BF Group...

20:26.450 --> 20:30.690
become the bad guy in all this!

20:31.960 --> 20:33.260
Dear...

20:34.930 --> 20:37.060
Now, go on.

20:37.500 --> 20:39.330
I can't handle that thing alone.

20:40.270 --> 20:44.570
But remember, I'm not staying
behind to save the world...

20:44.840 --> 20:47.640
and I'm not staying for Robo either.

20:48.240 --> 20:49.730
You know the reason...

20:53.780 --> 20:55.080
Taiso...

21:09.530 --> 21:10.530
Alberto!

21:11.730 --> 21:15.190
Taiso, I feel it's high
time we settled things.

21:32.050 --> 21:34.450
We know each other's moves too well...

21:34.690 --> 21:37.520
Everything will be
decided in a single strike!

21:37.790 --> 21:38.990
Fine by me!

22:09.160 --> 22:12.610
Thinking back, we've known
each other for a long time...

22:13.290 --> 22:16.820
Alberto, it looks like you're
serious about settling things today.

22:17.300 --> 22:18.530
Enough talk!

22:18.630 --> 22:20.500
We finish this now!

22:23.270 --> 22:25.200
Daisaku, what's the matter?

22:25.840 --> 22:27.900
Robo is waiting for you...

22:33.250 --> 22:34.840
Don't be depressed.

22:35.120 --> 22:38.310
Everyone makes mistakes from time to time.

22:38.720 --> 22:40.080
This is nothing.

22:40.650 --> 22:44.390
But what's important is
what you do afterward.

22:44.520 --> 22:46.460
I understand, Taiso...

22:46.860 --> 22:48.490
I'll try again.

22:53.900 --> 22:54.920
Good!

23:08.310 --> 23:11.840
Robo, can you hear my voice?

23:12.190 --> 23:13.190
Robo...

23:14.290 --> 23:17.780
If you can hear me, please stand up...

23:18.730 --> 23:20.720
and come back to me one more time.

23:21.330 --> 23:24.560
I realized something when you fell...

23:25.570 --> 23:29.660
I'd always thought that I was
fighting the BF Group alone until now!

23:30.140 --> 23:31.970
But I was wrong!

23:32.210 --> 23:35.540
We were with Issei, Tetsugyu...

23:35.740 --> 23:38.010
Youshi, Taiso...

23:38.240 --> 23:41.270
Commander Chujo, Professor Go...

23:42.650 --> 23:43.880
and Ginrei...

23:44.980 --> 23:46.950
Everyone was always by our side!

23:50.660 --> 23:53.350
So please stand again and fight!

23:53.730 --> 23:55.320
Let us all fight side by side!

23:57.160 --> 24:00.960
So come back to me! Robo!

24:01.940 --> 24:04.130
Giant Robo!

24:04.440 --> 24:07.070
Take to the skies!

24:42.080 --> 24:42.870
I've got you!

24:43.010 --> 24:45.340
No, I've won this battle...

24:49.850 --> 24:50.850
You fool!

24:50.950 --> 24:54.480
You mean you chose to
protect that rather than face me?

24:55.790 --> 24:59.230
Heh, that was my duty...

25:00.560 --> 25:02.790
Right, Daisaku?

25:03.700 --> 25:05.100
You've figured it out...

25:05.670 --> 25:07.900
Robo isn't something you command...

25:08.070 --> 25:09.900
It's someone you fight with side by side.

25:10.040 --> 25:12.160
Don't forget that...

25:24.020 --> 25:25.180
Robo!

25:25.520 --> 25:26.320
All right!

25:26.420 --> 25:27.680
Maximum power!

25:27.850 --> 25:29.910
We're escaping from the Shanghai area!

25:30.620 --> 25:32.520
But what about Brother Taiso?

25:33.260 --> 25:34.260
Hurry it up!

25:56.320 --> 25:58.310
What's the matter, Alberto...

25:59.550 --> 26:01.420
Do you want to come with me?

26:01.990 --> 26:03.420
What are you saying, Taiso?

26:03.590 --> 26:05.290
I won't accept this!

26:05.860 --> 26:09.390
This can't be the way our
rivalry comes to an end!

26:11.800 --> 26:13.270
Sorry...

26:15.400 --> 26:16.430
Taiso!

26:25.750 --> 26:26.870
Taiso...

26:28.720 --> 26:29.880
Big brother...

26:30.320 --> 26:31.810
Brother!

26:38.560 --> 26:40.050
The Anti-Shizuma field is coming!

26:50.900 --> 26:53.181
There's the first phenomenon
of the Anti-Shizuma field...

26:53.610 --> 26:55.630
the compression of
the Shizuma Drive core!

26:56.240 --> 26:57.300
This is good!

26:57.440 --> 27:00.240
Now we'll get the answers
to all our questions.

27:00.350 --> 27:03.780
And we'll find out if Professor
Vogler is really still alive!

27:03.920 --> 27:06.910
Now is the time for
the truth to be revealed!

27:10.260 --> 27:11.850
You there! Are you all right?

27:15.560 --> 27:17.860
I... I can't breathe!

27:18.430 --> 27:20.090
Commander!

27:23.070 --> 27:25.940
C-Can this be?

27:29.510 --> 27:31.310
N-No...

27:31.910 --> 27:33.640
This sample...

27:33.950 --> 27:35.280
Professor Vogler...

27:35.880 --> 27:37.210
He's...

27:38.520 --> 27:40.990
Oh no, Professor Go!

28:00.340 --> 28:01.830
Taiso...

28:04.940 --> 28:06.570
Ginrei

28:15.250 --> 28:16.250
Ginrei!

28:16.460 --> 28:17.460
Ginrei!

28:19.260 --> 28:21.250
I'm all right...

28:22.200 --> 28:24.690
Just got dizzy for a second.

28:24.860 --> 28:25.350
But...

28:25.470 --> 28:26.470
I'll be fine...

28:26.530 --> 28:28.900
Then, you used your power...

28:29.270 --> 28:32.710
Yes, but only a little bit...

28:33.310 --> 28:34.870
Her power?

28:35.010 --> 28:36.810
Teleportation...

28:38.040 --> 28:41.850
If she concentrates, she can
teleport to the other side of the world.

28:41.950 --> 28:45.980
Not even the BF Group's elite can do that.

28:46.120 --> 28:47.820
It's an amazing power...

28:47.950 --> 28:52.450
but for Ginrei, it's a
double-edged sword...

28:53.430 --> 28:55.420
When she uses it, her life is in danger.

28:55.530 --> 28:58.090
It's as if the power
sucks up her life force.

28:59.370 --> 29:01.700
So you used your power back then?

29:02.000 --> 29:03.060
Yes...

29:03.270 --> 29:06.470
Ten years ago, that's how I survived...

29:25.630 --> 29:28.560
F-Father...

29:29.160 --> 29:32.890
T-Then Ginrei is Professor Vogler's...

29:33.070 --> 29:35.000
There's nothing to be surprised about...

29:35.370 --> 29:37.360
If what we've heard is true...

29:37.470 --> 29:41.670
then the person who caused the
Tragedy of Bashtarle is Ginrei's father.

29:41.940 --> 29:47.400
But your father is the one who
made Giant Robo for the BF Group...

29:48.180 --> 29:53.420
In different ways, all of us have
something in our pasts that we keep inside.

29:53.720 --> 29:56.020
Yes, all of us here have
secrets that keep us from...

29:56.120 --> 29:58.150
living normal lives among the masses.

29:58.760 --> 30:01.320
Taiso always said that
no matter how it happens...

30:01.690 --> 30:03.960
or when it happens, it doesn't matter.

30:04.100 --> 30:07.160
No matter when death
comes, there'll be no sadness.

30:07.300 --> 30:09.430
That's the reason why we can do our duty.

30:09.540 --> 30:10.900
That's not true!

30:12.210 --> 30:18.510
There are people to mourn his death!

30:18.640 --> 30:22.810
Besides, he saved me when
I was little, and he told me that...

30:23.120 --> 30:27.520
even though we weren't born
together, we would at least die together.

30:28.150 --> 30:30.680
That's what Brother Taiso promised me...

30:30.790 --> 30:34.390
but he had to go and die all by himself.

30:35.600 --> 30:39.970
This is all my fault,
I was so stupid!

30:40.400 --> 30:43.340
It's entirely my fault!

30:45.340 --> 30:49.000
No, this is all my father's fault.

30:49.210 --> 30:51.870
Because this time around...

30:52.210 --> 30:56.480
he purposefully recreated
the Tragedy of Bashtarle...

31:15.500 --> 31:16.900
Intruder Alert!

31:17.000 --> 31:19.086
The target is moving from the
aft section toward the bridge!

31:19.110 --> 31:20.400
Intruder Alert!

31:20.610 --> 31:22.200
Intruder Alert!

31:24.280 --> 31:25.680
So they've come! The damn BF Group!

31:26.110 --> 31:27.110
Tetsugyu!

31:28.980 --> 31:30.510
You stay here!

31:31.620 --> 31:32.740
And this time...

31:32.850 --> 31:34.680
make sure you protect them!

31:43.300 --> 31:44.760
You got it, Big Sister!

31:45.700 --> 31:46.890
Good!

31:47.000 --> 31:50.370
Switch the controls to autopilot!
All personnel, prepare for combat!

31:56.040 --> 31:58.910
Listen Ginrei, if
something should happen...

31:59.180 --> 32:01.740
you take the case and
Daisaku and teleport out of here.

32:02.680 --> 32:05.170
It doesn't matter where, just
go as far away as you can!

32:05.550 --> 32:08.110
Even if it costs you your life...

32:16.760 --> 32:20.100
Daisaku, it was only for a little while...

32:20.430 --> 32:24.270
but you were like a son
to my husband and me so...

32:26.340 --> 32:28.270
Grow up to be a fine man!

32:29.110 --> 32:30.340
Youshi...

32:34.610 --> 32:36.910
All right then, let's get on with it!

32:39.190 --> 32:40.450
All personnel, fan out!

32:40.550 --> 32:43.320
Don't even let them
get close to the bridge!

32:46.530 --> 32:49.890
Cargo hold destroyed! Number five
and six diesel engines malfunctioning!

32:58.940 --> 33:00.070
There's only one target!

33:00.170 --> 33:01.300
The one in armor!

33:02.580 --> 33:04.510
Of all the possible
intruders, it's Enshaku!

33:04.640 --> 33:06.340
Issei! I need the usual!

33:06.450 --> 33:07.450
Got it!

33:08.810 --> 33:12.770
<i>Negawaku wa, shikido shinku,
taikyoku o motte ada o toru!</i>

33:23.930 --> 33:25.360
You fell for it!

33:45.180 --> 33:47.380
Daisaku, I'm sorry...

33:48.220 --> 33:53.920
It's my father... No, it's my
fault this is all happening...

34:00.100 --> 34:06.300
But still, I love my father.

34:06.640 --> 34:09.400
Don't you feel the same
way about your father?

34:11.110 --> 34:14.570
If so, then hand over that case...

34:22.050 --> 34:23.610
T-That voice!

34:41.170 --> 34:42.900
F-Father!

34:52.980 --> 34:55.210
Are you all right, Professor Go?

34:55.420 --> 34:57.250
W-Where am I?

34:57.380 --> 35:00.380
Relax, we're underground
in the Medical Wing.

35:00.520 --> 35:03.420
It seems you inhaled a bit too much smoke.

35:03.720 --> 35:08.090
Right, it suddenly got
hard to breathe and...

35:12.030 --> 35:16.940
Yes, but unfortunately, we lost the
mock-up simulation and all the data...

35:17.240 --> 35:22.700
But what bothers me is why it got hard
to breathe just before the explosion...

35:24.210 --> 35:25.650
What's wrong?

35:26.050 --> 35:31.420
How could I have overlooked
such an important detail?

35:31.550 --> 35:32.550
Important?

35:32.790 --> 35:33.790
Yes...

35:33.950 --> 35:38.820
I remember! There is another Professor
Vogler who could've made that sample...

35:41.760 --> 35:42.760
What?

35:42.960 --> 35:45.830
Then Professor Vogler is...

35:47.030 --> 35:48.030
Yes.

35:49.500 --> 35:51.870
He died many years ago...

35:54.880 --> 35:57.000
So it is you...

35:57.180 --> 35:59.740
but thinking back, it was so obvious.

35:59.850 --> 36:03.050
It's because of our ability to teleport...

36:03.180 --> 36:06.240
that we were able to survive
the Tragedy of Bashtarle.

36:09.520 --> 36:12.790
Now, come back to me, my daughter.

36:12.890 --> 36:16.800
And hand over the Sample
that is inside that case!

36:18.700 --> 36:20.290
Quickly, do it now!

36:25.970 --> 36:26.770
Why you...

36:26.910 --> 36:27.910
Silence!

36:31.040 --> 36:32.170
I-I can't move!

36:35.580 --> 36:37.550
Now daughter...

36:38.590 --> 36:40.610
Y-You're not my father!

36:42.290 --> 36:45.690
Father didn't have any powers of
teleportation or anything like that!

36:45.890 --> 36:47.860
W-What are you saying?

37:13.050 --> 37:14.820
Are we the only two left?

37:15.260 --> 37:17.120
Then there's only one course of action!

37:17.420 --> 37:18.420
Right!

37:21.030 --> 37:22.360
Hurry, Issei!

37:23.560 --> 37:24.560
Oh no!

37:41.050 --> 37:42.050
Enshaku!

37:43.150 --> 37:44.880
You're right, that's the bridge up ahead!

37:45.090 --> 37:48.610
But I can't let you pass by here!

37:50.190 --> 37:51.280
Blue Beast!

37:52.030 --> 37:53.760
Issei, I'm leaving the rest to you!

37:54.760 --> 37:55.760
I'm sorry...

38:23.190 --> 38:24.190
The case!

38:30.930 --> 38:33.160
No doubt about it, it's the Sample!

38:36.970 --> 38:38.170
Why won't it detach?

38:55.520 --> 38:56.720
The Sample!

38:57.090 --> 38:58.350
The Sample!

39:00.890 --> 39:03.190
It's my Sample!

39:06.370 --> 39:09.000
I'm still under his spell!

39:12.570 --> 39:13.770
The Sample!

39:21.880 --> 39:23.210
Reach it!

39:23.620 --> 39:25.880
It can't be, but that's...

39:26.020 --> 39:27.540
You can't have it!

39:30.020 --> 39:32.930
I'm not going to let you take it!

39:33.230 --> 39:37.690
Everyone died protecting that case!

39:38.600 --> 39:42.090
Professor Shizuma and Taiso...

39:42.300 --> 39:45.600
so I'm not going to let the
BF Group get their hands on it!

39:46.210 --> 39:47.570
How dare you!

39:47.710 --> 39:49.840
This is my property!

39:54.050 --> 39:55.070
I've got it!

39:55.820 --> 39:58.950
Now I can make the
whole planet stand still!

40:01.720 --> 40:02.720
No...

40:05.890 --> 40:09.090
You won't take it!

40:17.700 --> 40:19.170
The spell is broken!

40:25.950 --> 40:26.950
Robo!

40:29.220 --> 40:31.690
G-Giant Robo...

40:38.790 --> 40:41.990
That's good, Robo!
Just hang on a bit longer!

40:45.330 --> 40:49.630
I need you to protect
the others in my place!

41:00.710 --> 41:01.710
Live on!

41:04.080 --> 41:05.550
Tetsugyu!

41:07.650 --> 41:09.180
Ginrei!

41:09.860 --> 41:11.650
Daisaku!

41:40.020 --> 41:41.580
T-That's...

41:45.190 --> 41:46.490
There's no mistake...

41:47.830 --> 41:48.830
Brother!

41:50.400 --> 41:51.830
My brother Emmanuel!

42:02.810 --> 42:10.770
<i>What will be Daisaku's fate?</i>

42:11.820 --> 42:17.260
<i>To be continued...</i>

45:08.730 --> 45:12.260
I understand! I will keep the
promise I made to my father!

45:12.370 --> 45:13.646
I'll see it through along with Robo!

45:13.670 --> 45:16.030
Thinking back, the day that boy met Robo...

45:16.170 --> 45:20.270
the day he parted from his
father, was the beginning of it all.

45:20.410 --> 45:23.810
Can a new era be
reached without misfortune?

45:23.980 --> 45:27.710
Can happiness be
achieved without sacrifice?

45:27.980 --> 45:30.040
As if to answer those questions...

45:30.180 --> 45:33.480
a blizzard of hypocrisy
and lies is cleared away.

45:33.590 --> 45:37.750
Now, the whole truth
is about to be revealed!

45:37.920 --> 45:40.950
That's right, what really
happened on that day?

45:41.060 --> 45:43.330
What was our father really trying to do?

45:43.430 --> 45:47.060
I won't let you claim you've
forgotten, Farmelle von Vogler!

45:47.200 --> 45:48.260
Brother!

45:49.340 --> 45:56.900
Next time, The Truth of Bashtarle:
Gone Are The Days of Youth.
